: observation-repair
  0 64 s!
  begin 64 s@ 16 < while
    64 s@ 2 pf w@ 3 s@ = 64 s@ 0 pf w@ 5 = and if
      64 s@ 1 pf w@ industry-repair
    then 1 64 s+!
